BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (sales. Brown hammers the clawback: if the surety pays a valid claim on a carrier freight invoice, it comes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (back to the broker for reimbursement. That means the bond is not a free pass for late pay, sloppy cash flow,) Tj ET
