BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.77 Tm (Step: 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.55 Tm (Title: Lock Terms at Booking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.32 Tm (Action: Ask the broker about the detention rate per hour, when detention starts, and the layover and TONU) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.10 Tm (terms, then get them all written on the rate con.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.87 Tm (Detail: Ask before booking whether the broker pays detention, at what hourly rate, and after how many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.65 Tm (hours. If they refuse, do not stack a tight reload behind that load, and try negotiating a better line rate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.42 Tm ([Trucking Territory - Q-HgB9nn1jI @ 00:04:12]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.20 Tm (Step: 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.97 Tm (Title: Timestamp Arrival in Writing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.75 Tm (Action: Email the broker the moment the driver checks in, stating the arrival time, the detention start time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.52 Tm (and the hourly rate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.30 Tm (Detail: Use a script like: driver arrived at the shipper as of 1300, detention will start at 1500 at $50 per hour,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.07 Tm (and a heads-up will follow before it starts [Craig Bliss - WU9uuEFffXU @ 00:02:33]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.85 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.62 Tm (Title: Warn Before Free Time Expires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.40 Tm (Action: Alert the broker before the two hours run out, and use that window to start negotiating.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.17 Tm (Detail: Tell the broker the shipper has not loaded the truck yet and that detention starts if the shipper does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.95 Tm (not move in the next 20 minutes. This opens room to push for a higher rate [Pauline Nabacwa -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 91.72 Tm (fpu1Fhdo9Vs @ 00:04:45]) Tj ET
