BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (any load posted 20% above or below market gets heavy digging, 30% above market is most likely a scam) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (no matter which broker is named, and a Minneapolis to Elk River post paying $2,500 for 32 miles was an) Tj ET
