BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (vanish, leaving the broker to pay the second carrier again [gnxgKnnz6Jw @ 00:02:20].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (For brokers, the working stack layers vetting software over physical proof. Nate Cross runs Highway at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (Freight 360 brokerage for inspection history, registered equipment, community reports, and an ELD-fed map) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (of equipment locations, then makes GPS tracking mandatory for the full load when fraud is suspected; most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (fraudsters quit once challenged for tracking or an ELD download before payment [uGu6NcZkt28 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (00:01:57]. Cross also demands photos or video at the shipper showing equipment, the driver's face,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (registration, driver's license, and the MC on the truck door, zooming in for doctored images, and withholds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (the PO or pickup number until identity and location are confirmed. QuickScope automates that gate: the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (driver gets a text, takes a one-time photo inside a 2m geofence, and character recognition checks the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (company name, MC, and DOT before pickup details release automatically [uGu6NcZkt28 @ 00:03:45].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Hank Seaton estimates two-thirds to three-quarters of truckload shipments move without the carrier's name) Tj ET
