BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (party, and require the driver to present credentials, including a driver's license, satisfactory to the consignor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm ([jnoJihiGSEA @ 00:26:07].) Tj ET
