BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (brokerage, found through the DAT directory, to confirm the load number, the lane, and that they are listed as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (carrier of record; with small shops, ask the shipper which broker it uses, but never talk money, because that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (edges into back solicitation [3dI5z6SHDPc @ 00:29:21]. Cana also recommends drivers sign over a colored) Tj ET
